{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、舞台『帝一の國 』の最終章が\n無事、閉幕致しました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけでもう、\n美美子ちゃんに会えなくなっちゃった(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帝一くんにも、光明くんにも、弾くんにも、腐っても菊馬にも、びしゃもんちゃんこと毘沙門天様にも、、、\nもう、みんなに会えないんだなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くだらない話で笑い合ってた、大好きなヘアメイクさんや衣装さんやPAさん、\n3年間に渡ってずっと一緒にお仕事してきた皆さんとも、\n今日からもう..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも笑かしてくれた演出の顕作さんや、優しくしてくれた演助の友佳さんも..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってああダメだ、昨日から涙腺が...(つд∩)（笑）\n寂しくなんてないんだぞ、きっと花粉だな、ゴホゴホ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の夜中なんていきなり腹痛にみまわれて、転げまわりながら泣きながらそのまま寝たぜ、\n全部花粉のせいだな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また違う現場で会えたらいいなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか絶対会えるように頑張ります！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にこの舞台をつくってくださった方々、\nみんなみんないい人たちでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大千秋楽で、沢山のお客さんが泣いているのを見て、本当に愛されてる作品だったんだなあと心から嬉しく思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャストの皆さん、スタッフの皆さん、ご観劇くださった皆さま...\n3年間、本当に有難うございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この舞台に携われたこと、\nこの場所で出会えた沢山の人たちが、\n私の宝物です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過酷なスケジュールの中で、ここまで色々なことがあったけど、\nそれを話すと泣いちゃいそうなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は楽しかったことを思い出します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第三の美美子。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃんともギタさんとも\n美美子ちゃんを演じれて本当楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業式で最後、\n兎丸先生が下さった色紙。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ、原作の美美子ちゃんじゃない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっこれ、美美子ちゃんを演じてる\"私の似顔絵\"だ...！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと有難いことだろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宝物です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢白鳥美美子｣ちゃんは、人生で初めて与えて頂いた役。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が演じていいのか、本当は自信も持てなかったしこわかったし、最後までずっと葛藤してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこの役に出会えてほんと良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前向きにぐっばーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、帝一の國本番中に、\n次の舞台の稽古も始まりました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても面白くなりそうですっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すでに全公演完売してしまいましたが、\nなんと、追加公演が決定しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊日程は、 4月22日/15時開演"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊チケット販売は、4月1日12:00〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ\\(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://otonanocafe.com/\n↑詳しくは公式サイトへ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうだ！ビジュアルも公開されたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/29/7720756/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}